### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### WEBSERVICE SERVER — Testing Endpoint API
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### 1. Ambil semua kuliner aktif (tanpa filter radius)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/kuliner
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer my-secret-token

### 2. Ambil kuliner dalam radius 5km dari kampus UDINUS
GET http://localhost:8080/api/kuliner?lat=-6.9828&lng=110.4092&radius=5
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer my-secret-token

### 3. Ambil kuliner dengan pagination (halaman 2, 5 per halaman)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/kuliner?page=2&per_page=5
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer my-secret-token

### 4. Test tanpa API Key (harus ditolak — 401 Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/kuliner
Accept: application/json

### 5. Test dengan API Key yang salah (harus ditolak — 401 Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/kuliner
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer token-yang-salah
